Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:46:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1078/3799] soh: rename D_8014A6C4 -> gAudioHeapInitSizes

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the const AudioContextInitSizes read by AudioLoad for heapSize, initPoolSize and permanentPoolSize, and printed as the audio TOTAL in the debug display.
Defined in soh/src/code/audio_init_params.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/include/variables.h          |  2 +-
 soh/src/code/audio_general.c     |  2 +-
 soh/src/code/audio_init_params.c |  3 ++-
 soh/src/code/audio_load.c        | 12 ++++++------
 4 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

